  <h2>Read one complete message relay</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Alex’s 3:00 p.m. project note</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">Mina said she was running late because her train had been canceled that morning. She told me she could join the planning meeting online that day. She said she would bring the signed forms the next day. She also said the Harbor Station café closes at seven. I kept the present form because the schedule is still current and useful to the team.</span></p>
  </div>
